# Spaceport clerk. The golden ticket, cargo, the bots.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Arrivals and cargo only. Departures are by ticket.
#
o_text: How many passengers on the next ship?
o_id: wen_passengers
o_goto: Passengers
#
o_text: What are the bots on the dock for?
o_id: wen_bots
o_goto: Bots
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: wen_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Passengers
npc: (A pause just a little too long.) The manifest says cargo. Cold units, medical, military. Passenger berths are... allocated at the draw. I just stamp the forms.
effect: SetFlag('wen_slipped')
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: wen_passengers_back
o_goto: Default

name: Bots
npc: Dock sentries. Old models, one of them has a cracked optic. Don't tell anyone I said that, they'll budget for a new one and then I'll have nobody to blame.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: wen_bots_back
o_goto: Default

name: Bye
npc: Next.
effect: EndConversation
